Every man waits for 1 day.
Every man reads a book after at least 2 weeks of a visit.
Every man sees a woman within at most 4 weeks of a trip.
Every man sees a woman at an interval of at most 3 months.
Every man waits after 3 days.
If a man waits for more than 3 months then the man reads a book.
Every man that does not provably wait for less than 1 month sees a woman.
Every man waits for exactly 2 days.
Every woman reads a book before at most 3 hours of a visit.
